    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεργ-άτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
